+*   **Parameters**:
+    *   Smoothing/Distortion Coefficient = 0: Uses median interpolation method. Triangles are uniform in size, shape, and orientation. Model is rigid visually with reduced smoothness [S4].
+    *   Smoothing/Distortion Coefficient = 1: Uses linear interpolation method. Triangular patches change in size, shape, and direction according to the gradient of the gray value. Smoothness is improved at the cost of distortion [S4].
+    *   Smoothing/Distortion Coefficient = 0.25 and 0.75: Intermediate states between median and linear interpolation, balancing smoothness and distortion [S4].
 
